OL,3,GNEWSAKey route into city centre closed
OL,4,Aafter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA key route into Bristol is closed in
OL,7,Fboth directions due to a crash.
OL,9,FAvon and Somerset Police said officers
OL,10,Fwere called to reports of the incident
OL,11,Fon the A4320 St Philip's Causeway at
OL,12,F09:00 GMT, and subsequently closed the
OL,13,Fdual carriageway in both directions.
OL,15,FTraffic is queueing between the
OL,16,FLawrence Hill roundabout and The Retail
OL,17,FPark, as investigation work takes
OL,18,Fplace. There is a diversion in place
OL,19,Fwith congestion to nearby areas,
OL,20,Fincluding Old Market, Lawrence Hill and
OL,21,FRedfield.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
